{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09421","headline":"滁城对雪 · 韦应物","name":"滁城对雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨起满闱雪，忆朝阊阖时。\n玉座分曙早，金炉上烟迟。\n飘散云台下，凌乱桂树姿。\n厕迹鸳鹭末，蹈舞丰年期。\n今朝覆山郡，寂寥复何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}